WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.430 --> 00:00:07.083
Contour is a roofing website concept by Wallace Shift, built around clear decisions and a visual introduction to the roof.

2
00:00:07.722 --> 00:00:11.566
Its interactive three-dimensional study offers a top view.

3
00:00:11.825 --> 00:00:16.074
This is an illustrative model, not a measurement of the visitor’s property.

4
00:00:16.722 --> 00:00:21.995
The separate estimator lets a homeowner explore a sample roof and begin comparing the options.

5
00:00:22.639 --> 00:00:25.611
Choose metal and the planning range updates.

6
00:00:25.872 --> 00:00:29.289
These are sample prices, not a contractor quote.

7
00:00:29.930 --> 00:00:32.250
Use the estimate’s midpoint in the payment explorer.

8
00:00:32.510 --> 00:00:36.814
Change the term and compare both the monthly payment and total repayment.

9
00:00:37.430 --> 00:00:43.457
The visitor then brings their roof concern, timing, and estimate together in a project brief.

10
00:00:44.097 --> 00:00:49.110
This creates an unsent preview with the selected options and sample pricing clearly identified.

11
00:00:49.721 --> 00:00:56.380
A visual explanation becomes a practical comparison and an organized starting point for the contractor conversation.
